	abstract = {The use of pressurized ion exchange chromatography for the rapid separation of all the rare earth elements was demonstrated. With Dowex 50W-X8 ion exchange resin and a concentration gradient of α-hydroxyisobutyrate solution, quantitative separations were achieved in 1 to 2 hr when rare earth loadings were several per cent of the resin capacity. The results indicate that scale-up to industrial production rates is practical.},
