	abstract = {Hydrogen needs  in high concentration when it is used for energy source. PSA method and hydrogen separation film have been used in a current hydrogen refinement method. There are problems that much adsorption materials are needed and a high technique is required. Development of the device that the simple hydrogen refinement is necessary. We propose a simple hydrogen refinement method utilizing Soret effect that the concentration gradient increases with the increase of the temperature gradient are separated by Soret effect by flowing mixed gas in a mini channel. In our previous study, multiple separation process is necessary (concentration improvement of hydrogen was quite small by one separation).},
